{"text": "Once unclean, one cannot enter Temple.\nSo, a Red Heifer is required \nfor attending Temple services and offering sacrifices. \nSince there is no Temple today, it’s no problem being unclean. \n(Remember, unclean is not Sinful)\nRabbis have declared that everybody is unclean today \n(everybody is assumed to have come near a dead body \n– funeral home, cemetery, hospital, war, etc.) \n", "words": [{"t": "Once", "b": [0.2123, 0.1068, 0.2863, 0.1724]}, {"t": "unclean,", "b": [0.2947, 0.1068, 0.4142, 0.1724]}, {"t": "one", "b": [0.4225, 0.1068, 0.4725, 0.1724]}, {"t": "cannot", "b": [0.4808, 0.1068, 0.577, 0.1724]}, {"t": "enter", "b": [0.5854, 0.1068, 0.6593, 0.1724]}, {"t": "Temple.", "b": [0.6666, 0.1068, 0.7792, 0.1724]}, {"t": "So,", "b": [0.2986, 0.2224, 0.3421, 0.288]}, {"t": "a", "b": [0.3504, 0.2224, 0.3671, 0.288]}, {"t": "Red", "b": [0.3754, 0.2224, 0.4327, 0.288]}, {"t": "Heifer", "b": [0.4412, 0.2224, 0.5319, 0.288]}, {"t": "is", "b": [0.5396, 0.2224, 0.5619, 0.288]}, {"t": "required", "b": [0.5703, 0.2224, 0.693, 0.288]}, {"t": "for", "b": [0.1216, 0.2935, 0.1642, 0.3591]}, {"t": "attending", "b": [0.1719, 0.2935, 0.307, 0.3591]}, {"t": "Temple", "b": [0.3147, 0.2935, 0.419, 0.3591]}, {"t": "services", "b": [0.4274, 0.2935, 0.5384, 0.3591]}, {"t": "and", "b": [0.5471, 0.2935, 0.6008, 0.3591]}, {"t": "offering", "b": [0.6091, 0.2935, 0.7218, 0.3591]}, {"t": "sacrifices.", "b": [0.7301, 0.2935, 0.8699, 0.3591]}, {"t": "Since", "b": [0.0582, 0.4091, 0.1341, 0.4746]}, {"t": "there", "b": [0.1425, 0.4091, 0.2159, 0.4746]}, {"t": "is", "b": [0.2244, 0.4091, 0.2466, 0.4746]}, {"t": "no", "b": [0.2549, 0.4091, 0.2901, 0.4746]}, {"t": "Temple", "b": [0.2977, 0.4091, 0.4021, 0.4746]}, {"t": "today,", "b": [0.4105, 0.4091, 0.4966, 0.4746]}, {"t": "it’s", "b": [0.5049, 0.4091, 0.5479, 0.4746]}, {"t": "no", "b": [0.5562, 0.4091, 0.5914, 0.4746]}, {"t": "problem", "b": [0.5998, 0.4091, 0.7195, 0.4746]}, {"t": "being", "b": [0.7278, 0.4091, 0.8056, 0.4746]}, {"t